  "html": {
    "main": "<main data-writer-document>\n<header class=\"title-block\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">GPU allocation</h1>\n<p class=\"subtitle\">Reproducible results</p>\n<div class=\"authors\">\n<p class=\"author\"><span class=\"author-name\">J. Blaschke</span> <span class=\"author-affiliation\">Research</span> <a class=\"author-email\" href=\"mailto:j@example.com\">j@example.com</a> <span class=\"author-id\">0000-0000</span></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"date\">2026-10-24</p>\n<section class=\"abstract\" role=\"doc-abstract\">\n<p class=\"abstract-title\">Abstract</p>\n<p>One paragraph.</p>\n</section>\n</header>\n<h1 id=\"sec-intro\"><span class=\"number\">1</span> Introduction</h1>\n<p>Demand doubled <em>emph</em><strong>strong</strong><del>strikeout</del><sub>subscript</sub><sup>superscript</sup><u>underline</u><span class=\"smallcaps\">small_caps</span><code>sum(values)</code><span class=\"math inline\" data-math-style=\"inline\" data-tex=\"x^2\">x^2</span><span class=\"math inline math-source\" data-tex=\"alpha^2\"><code>alpha^2</code></span><a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Reference\">documentation</a><img src=\"asset:460c4d8bad9f\" alt=\"Inline plot\" style=\"width:70%\"><sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a id=\"fnref-1\" href=\"#fn-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">1</a></sup><sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a id=\"fnref-1-2\" href=\"#fn-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">1</a></sup><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#fig-throughput\">Figure 1</a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#sec-intro\">page 1</a><span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"knuth1984\">[1]</span><span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"knuth1984\">[1]</span><span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"knuth1984\">[1]</span><span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"knuth1984\">[1]</span><span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"knuth1984\">[1]</span><span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"knuth1984\">[1]</span><br>\n <span class=\"mark\">highlighted</span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Measured on the same hardware.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul class=\"task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled checked> Record version</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled>\n<pre class=\"hl-code numbered\"><code class=\"language-python\"><span class=\"line highlight\"><span class=\"hl-source hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-function-call hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-variable hl-function hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-generic-name hl-python\">run</span></span></span></span><span class=\"hl-meta hl-function-call hl-arguments hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-begin hl-python\">(</span><span class=\"hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-end hl-python\">)</span></span></span></span></code></pre>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>\n<p>Collect results</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<dl>\n<dt>Throughput</dt>\n<dd>\n<p>Work per second.</p>\n</dd>\n<dd>\n<p>A rate.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<figure id=\"fig-throughput\" class=\"figure kind-image\">\n<img src=\"asset:460c4d8bad9f\" alt=\"Throughput per node\" style=\"width:70%\">\n<figcaption><span class=\"caption-label\">Figure 1:</span> Throughput per node</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure id=\"tbl-throughput\" class=\"figure kind-table\">\n<figcaption><span class=\"caption-label\">Table 1:</span> Throughput per node</figcaption>\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width:25%\">\n<col style=\"width:25%\">\n<col style=\"width:25%\">\n<col style=\"width:25%\">\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Group</th>\n<th class=\"align-left\" scope=\"col\">Node</th>\n<th class=\"align-center\" scope=\"col\">GB/s</th>\n<th class=\"align-right\" scope=\"col\">Load</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">A</td>\n<td class=\"align-center\">42</td>\n<td class=\"align-right\">90%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"align-center\">43</td>\n<td class=\"align-right\">91%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tfoot>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">Summary</td>\n</tr>\n</tfoot>\n</table>\n</figure>\n<figure id=\"lst-example\" class=\"figure kind-listing\">\n<figcaption><span class=\"caption-label\">Listing 1:</span> Throughput per node</figcaption>\n<pre class=\"hl-code numbered\"><code class=\"language-python\"><span class=\"line highlight\"><span class=\"hl-source hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-function-call hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-variable hl-function hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-support hl-function hl-builtin hl-python\">print</span></span></span></span><span class=\"hl-meta hl-function-call hl-arguments hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-begin hl-python\">(</span><span class=\"hl-constant hl-numeric hl-integer hl-decimal hl-python\">42</span><span class=\"hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-end hl-python\">)</span></span></span></span></code></pre>\n</figure>\n<figure id=\"fig-panels\" class=\"figure kind-other\">\n<figure id=\"fig-left\" class=\"figure kind-image\">\n<img src=\"asset:460c4d8bad9f\" alt=\"Left panel\" style=\"width:70%\">\n<figcaption><span class=\"caption-label\">Figure 2:</span> Throughput per node</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure id=\"fig-right\" class=\"figure kind-image\">\n<img src=\"asset:460c4d8bad9f\" alt=\"Right panel\" style=\"width:70%\">\n<figcaption><span class=\"caption-label\">Figure 3:</span> Throughput per node</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figcaption><span class=\"caption-label\">Other 1:</span> Throughput per node</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<div id=\"eq-amdahl\" class=\"equation numbered\"><span class=\"math display\" data-math-style=\"display\" data-tex=\"T(n) = \\frac{W}{n} + c\">T(n) = \\frac{W}{n} + c</span><span class=\"equation-number\">(1)</span></div>\n<div id=\"eq-sum\" class=\"equation numbered\"><span class=\"math display math-source\" data-tex=\"sum_(i=0)^n i\"><code>sum_(i=0)^n i</code></span><span class=\"equation-number\">(2)</span></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout-note\" role=\"note\">\n<p class=\"callout-title\">Reproducibility</p>\n<p>Keep the compiler version fixed.</p>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"columns\" style=\"grid-template-columns:1 1\">\n<p>Container content.</p>\n</div>\n<img src=\"asset:460c4d8bad9f\">\n<hr>\n<div class=\"page-break\"></div>\n<nav class=\"toc\" role=\"doc-toc\">\n<p class=\"toc-title\">Contents</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"#sec-intro\"><span class=\"number\">1</span> Introduction</a></li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<section id=\"refs\" class=\"references csl-bib-body hanging-indent\" role=\"doc-bibliography\">\n<h1 class=\"references-title\">Bibliography</h1>\n<div id=\"ref-knuth1984\" class=\"csl-entry\"><div class=\"csl-left-margin\">[1]</div><div class=\"csl-right-inline\">D. Knuth. <em>The TeXbook</em></div></div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"cell\" data-cell=\"3\">\n<div class=\"cell-input\">\n<div class=\"cell-prompt\">In [2]:</div>\n<pre class=\"hl-code\"><code class=\"language-python\"><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"hl-source hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-function-call hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-generic-name hl-python\">df</span></span><span class=\"hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-punctuation hl-accessor hl-dot hl-python\">.</span></span><span class=\"hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-variable hl-function hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-generic-name hl-python\">describe</span></span></span></span><span class=\"hl-meta hl-function-call hl-arguments hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-begin hl-python\">(</span><span class=\"hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-end hl-python\">)</span></span></span></span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell-outputs\">\n<div class=\"output output-stream stdout\" data-mime=\"text/html\">\n<b>42</b>\n</div>\n<div class=\"output output-error\" data-mime=\"text/html\">\n<b>42</b>\n</div>\n<div class=\"output output-display\" data-mime=\"text/html\">\n<b>42</b>\n</div>\n<div class=\"output output-result\" data-mime=\"text/html\">\n<div class=\"cell-prompt\">Out [2]:</div>\n<b>42</b>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"footnotes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\">\n<hr>\n<ol>\n<li id=\"fn-1\">\n<p>Every run used the pinned image. <a class=\"footnote-back\" href=\"#fnref-1\" role=\"doc-backlink\">↩︎</a> <a class=\"footnote-back\" href=\"#fnref-1-2\" role=\"doc-backlink\">↩︎<sup>2</sup></a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</section>\n</main>\n",
    "title_block": "<header class=\"title-block\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">GPU allocation</h1>\n<p class=\"subtitle\">Reproducible results</p>\n<div class=\"authors\">\n<p class=\"author\"><span class=\"author-name\">J. Blaschke</span> <span class=\"author-affiliation\">Research</span> <a class=\"author-email\" href=\"mailto:j@example.com\">j@example.com</a> <span class=\"author-id\">0000-0000</span></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"date\">2026-10-24</p>\n<section class=\"abstract\" role=\"doc-abstract\">\n<p class=\"abstract-title\">Abstract</p>\n<p>One paragraph.</p>\n</section>\n</header>\n",
    "body": "<h1 id=\"sec-intro\"><span class=\"number\">1</span> Introduction</h1>\n<p>Demand doubled <em>emph</em><strong>strong</strong><del>strikeout</del><sub>subscript</sub><sup>superscript</sup><u>underline</u><span class=\"smallcaps\">small_caps</span><code>sum(values)</code><span class=\"math inline\" data-math-style=\"inline\" data-tex=\"x^2\">x^2</span><span class=\"math inline math-source\" data-tex=\"alpha^2\"><code>alpha^2</code></span><a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Reference\">documentation</a><img src=\"asset:460c4d8bad9f\" alt=\"Inline plot\" style=\"width:70%\"><sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a id=\"fnref-1\" href=\"#fn-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">1</a></sup><sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a id=\"fnref-1-2\" href=\"#fn-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">1</a></sup><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#fig-throughput\">Figure 1</a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#sec-intro\">page 1</a><span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"knuth1984\">[1]</span><span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"knuth1984\">[1]</span><span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"knuth1984\">[1]</span><span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"knuth1984\">[1]</span><span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"knuth1984\">[1]</span><span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"knuth1984\">[1]</span><br>\n <span class=\"mark\">highlighted</span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Measured on the same hardware.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul class=\"task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled checked> Record version</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled>\n<pre class=\"hl-code numbered\"><code class=\"language-python\"><span class=\"line highlight\"><span class=\"hl-source hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-function-call hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-variable hl-function hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-generic-name hl-python\">run</span></span></span></span><span class=\"hl-meta hl-function-call hl-arguments hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-begin hl-python\">(</span><span class=\"hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-end hl-python\">)</span></span></span></span></code></pre>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>\n<p>Collect results</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<dl>\n<dt>Throughput</dt>\n<dd>\n<p>Work per second.</p>\n</dd>\n<dd>\n<p>A rate.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<figure id=\"fig-throughput\" class=\"figure kind-image\">\n<img src=\"asset:460c4d8bad9f\" alt=\"Throughput per node\" style=\"width:70%\">\n<figcaption><span class=\"caption-label\">Figure 1:</span> Throughput per node</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure id=\"tbl-throughput\" class=\"figure kind-table\">\n<figcaption><span class=\"caption-label\">Table 1:</span> Throughput per node</figcaption>\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width:25%\">\n<col style=\"width:25%\">\n<col style=\"width:25%\">\n<col style=\"width:25%\">\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Group</th>\n<th class=\"align-left\" scope=\"col\">Node</th>\n<th class=\"align-center\" scope=\"col\">GB/s</th>\n<th class=\"align-right\" scope=\"col\">Load</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">A</td>\n<td class=\"align-center\">42</td>\n<td class=\"align-right\">90%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"align-center\">43</td>\n<td class=\"align-right\">91%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tfoot>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">Summary</td>\n</tr>\n</tfoot>\n</table>\n</figure>\n<figure id=\"lst-example\" class=\"figure kind-listing\">\n<figcaption><span class=\"caption-label\">Listing 1:</span> Throughput per node</figcaption>\n<pre class=\"hl-code numbered\"><code class=\"language-python\"><span class=\"line highlight\"><span class=\"hl-source hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-function-call hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-variable hl-function hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-support hl-function hl-builtin hl-python\">print</span></span></span></span><span class=\"hl-meta hl-function-call hl-arguments hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-begin hl-python\">(</span><span class=\"hl-constant hl-numeric hl-integer hl-decimal hl-python\">42</span><span class=\"hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-end hl-python\">)</span></span></span></span></code></pre>\n</figure>\n<figure id=\"fig-panels\" class=\"figure kind-other\">\n<figure id=\"fig-left\" class=\"figure kind-image\">\n<img src=\"asset:460c4d8bad9f\" alt=\"Left panel\" style=\"width:70%\">\n<figcaption><span class=\"caption-label\">Figure 2:</span> Throughput per node</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure id=\"fig-right\" class=\"figure kind-image\">\n<img src=\"asset:460c4d8bad9f\" alt=\"Right panel\" style=\"width:70%\">\n<figcaption><span class=\"caption-label\">Figure 3:</span> Throughput per node</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figcaption><span class=\"caption-label\">Other 1:</span> Throughput per node</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<div id=\"eq-amdahl\" class=\"equation numbered\"><span class=\"math display\" data-math-style=\"display\" data-tex=\"T(n) = \\frac{W}{n} + c\">T(n) = \\frac{W}{n} + c</span><span class=\"equation-number\">(1)</span></div>\n<div id=\"eq-sum\" class=\"equation numbered\"><span class=\"math display math-source\" data-tex=\"sum_(i=0)^n i\"><code>sum_(i=0)^n i</code></span><span class=\"equation-number\">(2)</span></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout-note\" role=\"note\">\n<p class=\"callout-title\">Reproducibility</p>\n<p>Keep the compiler version fixed.</p>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"columns\" style=\"grid-template-columns:1 1\">\n<p>Container content.</p>\n</div>\n<img src=\"asset:460c4d8bad9f\">\n<hr>\n<div class=\"page-break\"></div>\n<nav class=\"toc\" role=\"doc-toc\">\n<p class=\"toc-title\">Contents</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"#sec-intro\"><span class=\"number\">1</span> Introduction</a></li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<section id=\"refs\" class=\"references csl-bib-body hanging-indent\" role=\"doc-bibliography\">\n<h1 class=\"references-title\">Bibliography</h1>\n<div id=\"ref-knuth1984\" class=\"csl-entry\"><div class=\"csl-left-margin\">[1]</div><div class=\"csl-right-inline\">D. Knuth. <em>The TeXbook</em></div></div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"cell\" data-cell=\"3\">\n<div class=\"cell-input\">\n<div class=\"cell-prompt\">In [2]:</div>\n<pre class=\"hl-code\"><code class=\"language-python\"><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"hl-source hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-function-call hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-generic-name hl-python\">df</span></span><span class=\"hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-punctuation hl-accessor hl-dot hl-python\">.</span></span><span class=\"hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-variable hl-function hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-generic-name hl-python\">describe</span></span></span></span><span class=\"hl-meta hl-function-call hl-arguments hl-python\"><span class=\"hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-begin hl-python\">(</span><span class=\"hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-end hl-python\">)</span></span></span></span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell-outputs\">\n<div class=\"output output-stream stdout\" data-mime=\"text/html\">\n<b>42</b>\n</div>\n<div class=\"output output-error\" data-mime=\"text/html\">\n<b>42</b>\n</div>\n<div class=\"output output-display\" data-mime=\"text/html\">\n<b>42</b>\n</div>\n<div class=\"output output-result\" data-mime=\"text/html\">\n<div class=\"cell-prompt\">Out [2]:</div>\n<b>42</b>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
    "footnotes": "<section class=\"footnotes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\">\n<hr>\n<ol>\n<li id=\"fn-1\">\n<p>Every run used the pinned image. <a class=\"footnote-back\" href=\"#fnref-1\" role=\"doc-backlink\">↩︎</a> <a class=\"footnote-back\" href=\"#fnref-1-2\" role=\"doc-backlink\">↩︎<sup>2</sup></a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</section>\n",
